2025-07-15 01:17:36 | INFO     | api.endpoints.qa:generate_sse:402 - [EVENT_DEBUG] 收到事件: <class 'dict'> - {'type': 'knowledge_sources', 'data': {'knowledge_sources': [{'id': '86c96933-c794-48e3-a661-9f0ebba706ec', 'content': '问题: 对于地聚合物的抗压强度，固化温度、固化期和碱浓度这三个因素中，哪一个被认为是主导因素？其依据是什么？\n答案: A：固化温度被认为是影响地聚合物抗压强度的最主要因素。实验结果表明，无论碱浓度和固化期如何，地聚合物的抗压强度对固化温度的升高（从20°C到60°C）表现出最显著的响应，例如10M NaOH、3天固化期时，强度从20°C的约3 MPa大幅提升至60°C的31.88 MPa。在较高固化温度（如60°C和80°C）下，即使使用较低的碱浓度或较短的固化期，也能获得较高的抗压强度（约30 MPa），这说明高温能更有效地促进地聚合物化反应，导致离子活性增强和致密结构形成，其影响远超碱浓度和固化期。', 'title': 'QA: 对于地聚合物的抗压强度，固化温度、固化期和碱浓度这三个因素中，哪一个被认为是主导因素？其依据是什么？...', 'score': 0.8429532, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None}, {'id': '9cfb5aac-1625-4628-822c-ac5575f3342f', 'content': 'as the reaction proceeds (Bernal et al., 2015) ### 3.4 Phase diagrams for alkali-activated slag-based cements The prediction of several reaction products in the simulated AAS cements is consistent with the bulk chemical composition of the mixes, which generally lie outside the composition envelope of phase-pure C-(N-)A-S-H gel (Figure 8). Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006 Further analysis of AAS cement chemistry is performed by simulating phase diagrams at a fixed slag reaction extent of ${60}\\%$ , a constant amount of ${\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{\\;S}$ (equivalent in $\\mathrm{S}$ content to a slag composition of 2 mass% ${\\mathrm{{SO}}}_{3}$ , which is taken as a representative value of $\\mathrm{S}$ content in slags studied in the literature Ben Haha et al., 2011a; Bernal et al., 2014b. Gruskovnjak et al., 2006, Puertas et al., 2011; 注 6:土压力根据坝体外是否填有土石而定。 Richardson et al., 1994; Shi et al., 2006;) and slag compositions of either 30 or ${40}\\mathrm{{mass}}\