ource': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': 'b889f03f-7f1b-4f6d-82d7-68bb5e41acbc', 'content': '问题: 地聚合物的性能，特别是抗压强度，与原材料的整体化学组成（如SiO2或Al2O3的总含量）之间是否存在强相关性？这说明了什么？\n答案: 研究表明，地聚合物的性能（如抗压强度）与原材料的整体化学组成（如SiO2或Al2O3的总含量）之间存在较差的相关性。这意味着仅仅依靠原材料的总体化学组成来预测地聚合物的反应活性或最终性能价值不大。更重要的因素是材料的矿物含量、玻璃相含量和组成，以及这些活性组分在碱性介质中的溶解能力，这些才是真正控制地聚合物化反应和强度发展的关键。', 'title': 'QA: 地聚合物的性能，特别是抗压强度，与原材料的整体化学组成（如SiO2或Al2O3的总含量）之间是否存在...', 'score': 0.9141962699999999, 'source_type': 'qa_dataset', 'source': 'intelligent_retrieval', 'metadata': {'type': 'qa_dataset'}, 'highlights': None, 'question': '', 'answer': '', 'adopted': True}, {'id': '1847ad96-2715-43b3-99a6-a0aab9408c98', 'content': 'end-member of the MA-OH-LDH_ss thermodynamic model used in this work (thick black line) $\\left( {\\mathrm{P} = 1\\text{bar}}\\right)$ . The green triangles at ${\\log }_{10}\\left( {\\mathrm{\\;K}}_{\\mathrm{s}}\\right) = - {56.02}\\left( {{25}^{ \\circ }\\mathrm{C}}\\right.$ and $\\left. {1\\mathrm{{bar}}}\\right)$ , represents the solubility product used previously to describe this phase in the cement chemistry literature. Preprint of: R.J. Myers, B. Lothenbach, S.A. Bernal, J.L. Provis, Thermodynamic modelling of alkali-activated slag cements, Applied Geochemistry, 61 (2015): 233-247. Final published version available at http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.apgeochem.2015.06.006\n### 2.3 Occurrence of ${Mg}$ , Fe and S-bearing phases\nThermodynamic modelling of AAS cements requires consideration of additional constituent elements outside the $\\mathrm{{CaO}} - {\\mathrm{{Na}}}_{2}\\mathrm{O} - {\\mathrm{{Al}}}_{2}{\\mathrm{O}}_{3} - {\\mathrm{{SiO}}}_{2} - {\\mathrm{H}}_{2}\\mathrm{O}$ system, most notably $\\mathrm{{Mg}}$ , $\\mathrm{{Fe}}$ and $\\mathrm{S}$ , as well as carbonates. While the precipitation of $\\mathrm{{Mg}}$ in AAS cement is generally well explained by its incorporation into Mg-Al LDH phases (Ben Haha et